WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.314
Open Settings, then Travel.

00:00:03.164 --> 00:00:06.016
Your travel buffer is the extra time you
want around a journey.

00:00:07.266 --> 00:00:10.512
Tap Start Location to set a start address
or area, then save it.

00:00:11.412 --> 00:00:14.803
Check that it's the place you'll actually
be leaving from.

00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:17.527
Apple Maps estimates are optional.

00:00:18.379 --> 00:00:22.723
If you turn them on, addresses are sent to
Apple for the estimate, not your private
notes.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.517
Without an estimate, the app uses the
buffer.

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:30.081
A leave-by time is a planning aid, not a
promise that you'll arrive on time.

00:00:30.981 --> 00:00:33.559
Check the journey and allow for anything
the estimate won't know about.
